@startuml
title Task 6 — Daily Knowledge Base Update Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Document owner" as Owner
folder "data/incoming_docs" as Source
component "scripts/update_index.py" as Updater
database "Manifest\nindex_manifest.json" as Manifest
component "Chunking\nRecursiveCharacterTextSplitter" as Chunking
component "Embeddings\ntext-embedding-3-small" as Embeddings
database "FAISS index\nvectorstore/index.faiss\nvectorstore/index.pkl" as Faiss
folder "data/knowledge_base" as KnowledgeBase
folder "docs/task6_logs" as Logs
component "Windows Task Scheduler\nDaily 06:00" as Scheduler

Owner --> Source : adds/updates .md/.txt files
Scheduler --> Updater : starts daily
Updater --> Source : scans files
Updater --> Manifest : reads hashes
Updater --> KnowledgeBase : copies new/changed files
Updater --> Chunking : splits documents into chunks
Chunking --> Embeddings : sends chunks for vectorization
Embeddings --> Faiss : rebuilds vector index
Updater --> Manifest : writes updated hashes
Updater --> Logs : writes update_index.log.json

@enduml
